Two angles are $70^{\circ}$, so the two sides opposite them are equal and the triangle is isosceles.
The largest angle is $70^{\circ}$, and $70^{\circ}<90^{\circ}$, so no angle is obtuse.
Jai is wrong: the triangle is acute isosceles.

